  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity building for Asia Climate Change Consortium policy and advocacy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is focused on enabling and improving climate change advocacy across Asia, and strengthened policy and advocacy work on key climate issues. Activities will include development of common policy positions, strengthening of climate networks ahead of key advocacy moments, advocacy towards ASEAN negotiators, conducting online campaigns, digital advocacy capacity development, capacity building through appointing coordinator to manage activities</narrative>
  </description>
